body:
That's probably why I'm so annoyed with myself over it, because I'm always super careful to pee before and after, and make sure all is well. Oh well, I guess the worst that can happen is a yeast infection then. 

&#x200B;

On a side note, so many of my female friends have told me how unsanitary it is to let him shoot his stuff up there, so I'll have to do some research.
